        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f90bab0a-ec88-52fe-aac1-14768bf6dad8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Orlando, Florida; Downtown Orlando; West Lakes neighborhoods\n- Venues: Camping World Stadium; Orlando City Stadium; Amway Center; Dr. Phillips Center for the Performing Arts\n- Sports Teams: Orlando City SC; Orlando Pride\n- Organizations: Major League Soccer; National Women's Soccer League; National Football League\n- Events: 2017 Pro Bowl\n\nFacts:\n- Orlando City SC entered Major League Soccer as an expansion franchise in 2015.\n- Orlando City Stadium is the home venue for Orlando City SC and for its National Women's Soccer League sister club, the Orlando Pride.\n- The 2017 Pro Bowl was the National Football League's all-star game for the 2016 season, and it was played at Camping World Stadium in Orlando, Florida on January 29, 2017.\n- Camping World Stadium, also known as the Orlando Citrus Bowl, is a stadium in Orlando, Florida.\n- Camping World Stadium is in the West Lakes neighborhoods of Downtown Orlando, west of the Amway Center, the Dr. Phillips Center for the Performing Arts, and Orlando City Stadium.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
